    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>γ</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>γ</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Using cramer’s rule<br /><math><mo>∆</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, the system of equations has infinite solutions<br />Put <math><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>∵</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfies&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\